\">台語字母應該ài有家己ê名</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/lanmai-aie.html\">&nbsp;<span>/&nbsp;江宥呈</span></a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">36<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/lanmai-kap.html\">重溪kap雙溪</a></span><span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/lanmai-kap.html\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span>/&nbsp;Bí-hûn</a></span></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有</span></h2></div><div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">16<span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sa-kap-e.html\">〈保正伯〉kap〈放屎百姓〉:</a></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sa-kap-e.html\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>蔡秋桐ê台語小說</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span>主講／陳淑容&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">記錄／蔡玉薰</span></a></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</span></h2></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">20<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_93.html\">雞事</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_93.html\">&nbsp;<span>/ 藍春瑞</span></a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趣味答喙鼓</span></h2></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">22<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_27.html\">自然風愛地球</a></span><a h