=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><div><h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h2></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">32<span>&nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sann-kap-70-tsiah.html\">人生70 tsiah開始</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sann-kap-70-tsiah.html\">&nbsp;<span>/&nbsp;</span><span>澎錦</span></a></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">42<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sann-kap.html\">我無痟（五）</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/sann-kap.html\">&nbsp;<span>/&nbsp;</span><span>杜信龍</span></a></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">35 百字寫台文tio̍h獎名單</span></h2></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjjwcC3Otfi0k89lfYUq93Mi5cB2HzbZHblDbDFio6eb9XPa_9MhUCAe7uOROEGFBTiIUdc0dw5gNTy1uk6JPyu2eyohcvN5lbktkUNnp8-bgdb_UA4_sE6qinGsdXuFgEuxQ2dz7cY8pAIoW0QZibXmpGu8KsX6mD-2QhVSREGRNGP8TYdFz8w6WQcnIJK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjjwcC3Otfi0k89lfYUq93Mi5cB2HzbZHblDbDFio6eb9XPa_9MhUCAe7uOROEGFBTiIUdc0dw5gNTy1uk6JPyu2eyohcvN5lbktkUNnp8-bgdb_UA4_sE6qinGsdXuFgEuxQ2dz7cY8pAIoW0QZibXmpGu8KsX6mD-2QhVSREGRNGP8TYdFz8w6WQcnIJK=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiBAYmIiENmMmZKzLI13MHaGfv0yKLd-get